==== keepalived-advanced modal check_cmd
h4: High Availability - Advanced VRRP - check_cmd
check_cmd.check_type [CBI.ListValue] Health Check Type: select=command {command,dataplane}
check_cmd.vrrp_instance [CBI.DynamicList] Managed VRRP Instances: 
  help: Automatically track this check from every selected instance. Select all internal gateway groups that must move together; no manual VRRP Instance edit is needed.
check_cmd.script [CBI.Value] Script Command: value=/bin/ping -c 1 -W 1 192.168.50.1 (placeholder "/bin/ping -c 1 -W 1 8.8.8.8")
  help: Command returning 0 for success. Use absolute paths.
check_cmd.interval [CBI.Value] Interval: value=5 (placeholder "5")
  help: Seconds between checks.
check_cmd.timeout [CBI.Value] Timeout: value=2 (placeholder "2")
  help: Maximum seconds for the complete check. For dataplane checks, allow for all targets to time out.
check_cmd.weight [CBI.Value] Weight: value= (placeholder "0")
  help: Leave empty or use 0 to put the instance in FAULT after repeated failures. A non-zero value only adjusts priority.
check_cmd.rise [CBI.Value] Rise: value= (placeholder "2")
  help: Successes before healthy.
check_cmd.fall [CBI.Value] Fall: value= (placeholder "2")
  help: Failures before unhealthy.
check_cmd.user [CBI.Value] User: value= (placeholder "root")
  help: Run as user (default: root).
<button> Dismiss
<button> Save
==== keepalived-advanced modal dp_both
h4: High Availability - Advanced VRRP - dp_both
dp_both.check_type [CBI.ListValue] Health Check Type: select=dataplane {command,dataplane}
dp_both.vrrp_instance [CBI.DynamicList] Managed VRRP Instances: item=main item=vpn
  help: Automatically track this check from every selected instance. Select all internal gateway groups that must move together; no manual VRRP Instance edit is needed.
dp_both.interface [CBI.ListValue] Dataplane Device: select=br-lan {,br-lan,eth0,eth1}
  help: Linux device used for carrier checks and interface-bound probes, for example bond0.87.
dp_both.bond [CBI.ListValue] LACP Bond Device: select= {}
  help: Optional parent 802.3ad bond. When set, the checker also verifies the active LACP member count.
dp_both.target [CBI.DynamicList] Probe Targets: item=192.168.50.20
  help: Literal IPv4 or IPv6 addresses reachable through the dataplane device. Local addresses are skipped automatically.
dp_both.min_success [CBI.Value] Minimum Successful Targets: value=1
  help: The check succeeds as soon as this many non-local targets reply. Use 1 to fail only when every target is unreachable.
dp_both.min_lacp_members [CBI.Value] Minimum LACP Members: value=0
  help: Minimum active members reported by the parent bond. Use 0 to disable this check.
dp_both.probe_timeout [CBI.Value] Per-Target Probe Timeout: value=1
  help: Seconds allowed for each individual ping. Keep the VRRP script timeout above the worst-case total.
dp_both.interval [CBI.Value] Interval: value=2 (placeholder "5")
  help: Seconds between checks.
dp_both.timeout [CBI.Value] Timeout: value=3 (placeholder "2")
  help: Maximum seconds for the complete check. For dataplane checks, allow for all targets to time out.
dp_both.weight [CBI.Value] Weight: value= (placeholder "0")
  help: Leave empty or use 0 to put the instance in FAULT after repeated failures. A non-zero value only adjusts priority.
dp_both.rise [CBI.Value] Rise: value= (placeholder "2")
  help: Successes before healthy.
dp_both.fall [CBI.Value] Fall: value= (placeholder "2")
  help: Failures before unhealthy.
dp_both.user [CBI.Value] User: value= (placeholder "root")
  help: Run as user (default: root).
<button> Dismiss
<button> Save
